Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Stage 2: accessible command palette (Ctrl/Cmd+K)

- commands.ts: typed command list derived from existing profile/projects
  data and page section ids; token-ranked filtering; scrollToId helper
  (updates hash, moves focus to target)
- CommandPalette: ARIA combobox + listbox dialog, aria-activedescendant,
  focus trap, Esc, inert page root, scroll lock, focus restore, clipboard
  feedback, no new dependencies
- palette.tsx: small context so the nav button and shortcut share state
- Nav: visible Search button (works on touch, shows platform shortcut)
- ProjectCard: id + scroll-mt so projects are linkable/jumpable
- index.css: entrance animation (collapsed by existing reduced-motion rule)

